# Environment Variables

Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in your values.
**Never commit `.env.local` to version control.**

```bash
cp .env.example .env.local
```

---

## Sentry (#773)

### VITE_SENTRY_DSN

The Sentry Data Source Name for your project.
Find it at: **Sentry Dashboard → Settings → Projects → <your-project> → Client Keys (DSN)**

```
VITE_SENTRY_DSN=https://<key>@o<org-id>.ingest.sentry.io/<project-id>
```

Leave blank (or omit) to disable Sentry error reporting in development.

### VITE_SENTRY_TRACES_SR

Override the performance tracing sample rate (float 0.0–1.0). Default: `0.1` (10%).

```
VITE_SENTRY_TRACES_SR=0.1
```

### VITE_APP_VERSION

Attach a release version string to Sentry events for source map resolution.
Typically set during CI/CD from a git tag or commit SHA.

```
VITE_APP_VERSION=1.0.0
```
